From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:56:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Node/Express + SQLite API and React UI school ERP
 (additive)

Adds a self-contained second stack beside the Laravel app (untouched):

- server/: Express 4 + better-sqlite3 (WAL), JWT with token versioning,
  versioned migrations, views, triggers, FTS5, idempotent payments,
  append-only audit log, 7 cron jobs, online backups, 18 smoke tests.
- client/: React 18 + Vite role-based UI (admin, teacher/class teacher,
  finance, parent, student, driver) with light/dark theme.
- Modules: students & ID cards, attendance, exams & marks, timetable
  auto-generation, question papers, diary, fees and payment portal,
  cash book and bank-deposit verification, expenses and budgets,
  leave and change requests (parent -> class teacher), support tickets,
  notices and calendar, community, transport with live bus tracking and
  driver console, HRMS and payroll, account approvals, system tools.
- docs/erp/: setup guide and per-role user manuals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
